Always use the most appropriate directory in src/ for new or updated files or folders.
Always keep the src/ directory Professional, Clean, tidy, and organized Free of redundancies and clutter.
Always use the `/docs` directory for documentation files.
Always use the `/src/memlog` directory for memlog files.
Always use the `/src/core/utils` directory for utility files.
